{"data":[{"conversation_id":"2097524397783556471","created_at":"2026-09-09T03:16:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097524397783556471"],"id":"2097524397783556471","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":256,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"人生可能性和年龄无关，和心态、选择有关。\n\n只要你愿意一直接受新的东西，愿意跟随着时代去变化，那么你的人生就依然有很多的机会，依然有无限的可能。"},{"conversation_id":"2096262071327535344","created_at":"2026-09-05T15:39:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096262071327535344"],"id":"2096262071327535344","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":60,"impression_count":21462,"like_count":193,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":40},"text":"普通人在这个世界上留存不超过150年，因为，生命的上限基本是100岁，在过世后50年，就会被忘得一干二净，如同从没来过一样。\n\n人类自然老去后，前几年还会被儿孙祭奠，随着时间的推移，50年后儿孙也变成老人了，自己的人生很多东西已经顾不上了，何况上一辈人的事。"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2095682825240662016","3_2095682825244839939"]},"conversation_id":"2095682839434207724","created_at":"2026-09-04T01:18:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2095682839434207724"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/XrUT4hyne8","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ityouknows/status/2095682839434207724/photo/1","media_key":"3_2095682825240662016","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/XrUT4hyne8"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/XrUT4hyne8","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ityouknows/status/2095682839434207724/photo/1","media_key":"3_2095682825244839939","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/XrUT4hyne8"}]},"id":"2095682839434207724","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":21027,"like_count":69,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":10},"text":"昨天晚上，科技圈发生了两件大事。\n\n第一，GPT-6 Astra 发布。\n\n昨天全网不少 AI 服务还一度出现异常，大家开玩笑说：是不是 GPT-6 太强，把其他大模型都“干宕机”了。😂\n\n玩笑归玩笑，但这一次 GPT-6 的进化，确实让我越来越强烈地感觉到：\n\nAGI，已经不再只是一个遥远的概念。\n\n第二件事，特斯拉 https://t.co/XrUT4hyne8"},{"conversation_id":"2095365502386520417","created_at":"2026-09-03T04:17:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2095365502386520417"],"id":"2095365502386520417","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":3789,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"很多时候，当你选择进入什么样的环境，人生的走向其实就已经开始改变了。\n\n如果你身边的人，天天研究打麻将，你很难完全不受影响；\n\n如果你身边的人，每天聊的是 AI、创业、搞钱、做项目，你也很难对这些东西毫无兴趣。\n\n人其实比自己想象中，更容易被环境塑造。"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2093885779642900481"]},"conversation_id":"2093885798328500697","created_at":"2026-08-30T02:17:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2093885798328500697"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/hmfVCA8BRI","end":147,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ityouknows/status/2093885798328500697/photo/1","media_key":"3_2093885779642900481","start":124,"url":"https://t.co/hmfVCA8BRI"}]},"id":"2093885798328500697","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1110,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这段时间一直流行一句话：\n\n美貌+任何行业或者技能，都是王炸，唯独单出没有用。\n\n其实创业也是一样。\n\n资源+能力+执行力，才是王炸。\n\n单纯有资源，没有能力，守不住；\n单纯有能力，没有执行力，跑不起来；\n单纯有执行力，没有方向，也只是忙忙碌碌。 https://t.co/hmfVCA8BRI"}],"meta":{"newest_id":"2097524397783556471","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwoxjsgqcbsx74qy9p8aqqifz3n587","oldest_id":"2093885798328500697","result_count":5}}